5,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's make this quick and fair, shall we? I want to see exactly how the space is divided and what the ward expects from us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need a practical solution that doesn't just shift the problem. I'm interested in how other areas handle this daily.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! But wait, do we even know how much this is costing us right now? We should check the money side of things first!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone happy. I'd like to understand why the complaints are happening and how others get along.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us look at the facts with a calm heart. I wish to understand the true burden this places on our time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, money is one thing, but the physical burden is another. I'm not interested in a ""solution"" that's just a fancy word for ""same as before.""","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, that's why we should look at the actual results of other blocks. It's better to learn from their mistakes than to repeat them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I just don't want anyone to be sad because the bill is too high! Let's look at the ledger and the subsidies!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that's very thoughtful of you. I think it's also important to see the meeting minutes from the station block to see how they reached an agreement.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is the invisible labor that often weighs the heaviest on the soul. Let us ensure we see the reality of the daily routine.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly, Servas. The ""invisible"" part is what I'm worried about. I'll be checking the frontage measurements to see who's actually providing the space.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll focus on the actual lived experience. I want to see the bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll stick with the money stuff! I want to see the block ledger and the ward subsidy. I'll be the money expert!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the complaint log and the station block's meeting minutes. I want to see how we can heal the tension between us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,A wise approach. I shall look into the truck arrival times and the supervised mornings. Time is the only currency we cannot earn back.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan. Let's hope the findings are surprising!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
