60,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is the only one that actually addresses the fairness of the location. I'm not voting for B or C.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option A is the most logical. C creates a smell trap in August, and B is a time-sink that will lead to resentment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option C sounds cool, and with the subsidy, it's not too bad! But if it's too expensive for some, maybe A is better?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option A seems like it could be a bit chaotic, but it prevents one person from feeling targeted or burdened. It's a fair compromise.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B asks too much of our precious time. Option C is a physical solution to a human problem. Option A shares the burden equally.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, don't be fooled by the ""cool"" factor of a shelter. It just cements the unfairness of the current location.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, think about the maintenance. Who cleans the shelter? Who deals with the smell? Option A is cleaner in the long run.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're right. I just wanted something that looked nice, but if A is the fairest for everyone's wallet and space, I'm for it!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're agreeing. If we all agree on A, it shows we're willing to share the burden together. That's the most important part.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"When we share the weight, the load becomes light. Option A is a lesson in mutual support.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,I'm glad we're on the same page. I can finally stop worrying about being the only one who sees the unfairness.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It's the most sustainable choice. No permanent smell, no rigid supervision schedules, and no spatial bias.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll help make the rotation map! I can make it colorful so it's easy for everyone to read!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that's a lovely idea. It will make the transition feel more like a community project than a chore.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,A colorful map is a wonderful touch. It turns a duty into a shared journey.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,Let's vote. I'm sticking with A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. A it is.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Kenji,,A! Let's do it!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Midori,,I vote for A. I'm happy we're all talking so kindly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,My heart is at peace. I vote for A.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
